":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"run\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.6,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-jsonl:ddfb927363750eb3c0b9c69ddecc25162346f12cd6dd205762f2d54c7be6296a:ruled-out:1\",\"legacy-jsonl:ddfb927363750eb3c0b9c69ddecc25162346f12cd6dd205762f2d54c7be6296a:ruled-out:2\"],\"focus\":\"Rank the cross-CLI options by gain per unit of floor risk\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which remaining cross-CLI gap ranks first by started-when-useful gain per unit of floor risk, and what file does each fix change?\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T08:13:20.000Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":5,\"run\":5,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.7,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-jsonl:3a60b221d928e75aff5a4786a93e3feea6ae02a5603c37c035b644a6b55654c5:ruled-out:1\",\"legacy-jsonl:3a60b221d928e75aff5a4786a93e3feea6ae02a5603c37c035b644a6b55654c5:ruled-out:2\"],\"focus\":\"The degraded path: what it loses, who hits it, and the smallest fix\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What does the degraded (daemon-unreachable) path lose per runtime that the live path keeps, and what is the smallest change that makes the fallback carry the same command?\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T08:22:41.000Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":6,\"run\":6,\"status\":\"insight\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.3,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-jsonl:86f40cc64f48b24994a70bd0fda4ae8ab7e46cdcc98a65c1efc362ca5e11e357:ruled-out:1\",\"legacy-jsonl:86f40cc64f48b24994a70bd0fda4ae8ab7e46cdcc98a65c1efc362ca5e11e357:ruled-out:2\"],\"focus\":\"Floor-input map and the close of question coverage\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"answeredQuestions\":[\"(e) Claude Code lists 32 of 44 commands because a command file named `skill.md` collapses its folder: which options keep every operator-facing command name intact, what does each cost per runtime (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh), and what check proves 44 of 44?\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T08:29:05.000Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"stem\":\"deep_research.synthesis_complete\",\"lineageId\":\"cross-cli-3\",\"runId\":\"cross-cli-3\",\"answeredCount\":5,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"totalIterations\":6,\"totalQuestions\":5,\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T06:27:41.882Z\"}\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"head -30 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-3/deep-research-state.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801376722,"end":1794801377252}}}}
