ffered 5\ndelivery opencode on runs 44 scored 44 unknown 44 offered 5\ndelivery pi off runs 36 scored 36 unknown 0 offered 5\ndelivery pi on runs 44 scored 44 unknown 0 offered 5\ndelivery devin off runs 36 scored 36 unknown 1 offered 5\ndelivery devin on runs 44 scored 44 unknown 1 offered 5\ndelivery dsh off runs 36 scored 36 unknown 0 offered 5\ndelivery dsh on runs 44 scored 44 unknown 1 offered 5\nmismatch 0\nlimit: a loaded document is not a followed step, so followed counts a workflow opened before the first write, not each step done\nlimit: OpenCode delivery reads unknown in both arms, so its arms rest on the switch alone; Codex is not measured (Q075)\nlimit: the off arm also makes the Gate 2 direct call abstain, so the arms compare the advisor off with on, not the brief alone\nlimit: the off arm's offered command is the head the runner's replay would have carried, not one the model saw\nlimit: a runtime's paired line is direction only, each fit and skill-only row has one run per arm (option D), and fresh-skill-04 moved head on devin and dsh, so those turns end restore-failed\nlimit: Claude also reads the home CLAUDE.md in both arms\nfloor fixture {\"own\":2,\"attached\":0,\"combined\":2,\"total\":44}\nfloor real {\"own\":5,\"attached\":0,\"combined\":5,\"total\":44}\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && ls specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/ && cat specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/arm-evidence.txt 2>/dev/null | head -80\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801400866,"end":1794801401768}}}}
