esktop app, and with no CODEX_HOME override) at exactly this path: cd /private/var/folders/3c/zfqcqsts0kn19cgblj82gqhm0000gn/T/skilled-behaviour-arenas/fresh-codex && codex. Trust the folder when it asks, run /hooks, approve every entry, then quit. The other five runtimes are already running their 720 sessions. Has that been done?\n```\n\nOptions:\n```text\nDone, check again\nLeave Codex out\n```\n\nAnswer:\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && sed -n '1480,1500p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/decision-record.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801669806,"end":1794801672173}}}}
