 to 3, and it survives opencode missing delivery reader.\\\", sources: [\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json\\\"] },\\n  { id: \\\"f-iter003-005\\\", label: \\\"Devin is the only runtime whose refusal path is observable, with offerDeclined 1 in both arms against 0 everywhere else; the single asked classification belongs to claude off, so asking and declining were each observed on a different runtime and never together.\\\", sources: [\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/summary-arm.json\\\"] }\\n];\\nconst lines = [JSON.stringify(record)];\\nfor (const f of findings) lines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: \\\"finding\\\", id: f.id, label: f.label, iteration: 3, sources: f.sources }));\\nfs.writeFileSync(dir + \\\"/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\\\", lines.join(\\\"\\\\n\\\") + \\\"\\\\n\\\");\\nconst tmp = fs.mkdtempSync(require(\\\"os\\\").tmpdir() + \\\"/dr5-i3-\\\");\\nfs.writeFileSync(tmp + \\\"/event.json\\\", JSON.stringify(record));\\nprocess.stdout.write(tmp + \\\"/event.json\\\\n\\\");\\n' \\\"$LINEAGE\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801813378,"end":1794801824499}}}}
