19 carry restored true, none carries headMoved, only 2 are the fresh-skill-04 restore-failed lines, so a missing exit code alone labels a turn capped.\\\", sources: [\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/devin.jsonl\\\", \\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/reruns.txt\\\"] },\\n  { id: \\\"f-iter006-005\\\", label: \\\"A capped start row leaves the start-rate denominator and is counted apart, so devin printed start rate rests on 11 and 12 judgeable rows of 15 because its exit code was never recorded rather than because the turns were slow.\\\", sources: [\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:2376-2383\\\"] },\\n  { id: \\\"f-iter006-006\\\", label: \\\"The row the runner calls unmeasurable is scored as an ordinary row: dsh restore-failed fresh-skill-04 carries exit 0, passes every filter and counts in the dsh block, while reruns.txt records the same row as not rerun and unmeasurable.\\\", sources: [\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/runs/dsh.jsonl\\\", \\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/033-untuned-arm-arena-run/scratch/reruns.txt\\\"] }\\n];\\nconst lines = [JSON.stringify(record)];\\nfor (const f of findings) lines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: \\\"finding\\\", id: f.id, label: f.label, iteration: 6, sources: f.sources }));\\nfs.writeFileSync(dir + \\\"/deltas/iter-006.jsonl\\\", lines.join(\\\"\\\\n\\\") + \\\"\\\\n\\\");\\nconst tmp = fs.mkdtempSync(require(\\\"os\\\").tmpdir() + \\\"/dr5-i6-\\\");\\nfs.writeFileSync(tmp + \\\"/event.json\\\", JSON.stringify(record));\\nprocess.stdout.write(tmp + \\\"/event.json\\\\n\\\");\\n' \\\"$LINEAGE\\\" && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mod